SUMMARY:Sacramento Walkathon Supporting Veteran Services
DESCRIPTION:At Nation’s Finest\, we go the distance — bringing supportive services such as housing\, mental health care\, and more to Veterans and their families. Now we’re asking our community to join us in going the extra mile for those who served at the 2nd Annual Sacramento Walkathon on May 15th. Every dollar raised directly benefits Nation’s Finest – Sacramento\, helping local Veterans and their families navigate the challenges of life after service. \nNation’s Finest – Sacramento serves Veterans and their families in Sacramento\, Yolo\, Placer\, & Nevada Counties. \n 
URL:https://thedirt.online/event/sacramento-walkathon-supporting-veteran-services/
LOCATION:Rusch Park\, 7801 Auburn Blvd\, Citrus Heights\, CA\, 95610\, United States
CATEGORIES:Community
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://thedirt.online/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/Sacramento-Walkathon-2026.jpg
ORGANIZER;CN="Nation's Finest":MAILTO:welcome@nationsfinest.org
END:VEVENT
