SUMMARY:SSRI R&B/Jazz Quintet Live @ The Melon Ball
DESCRIPTION:SSRI is a modern jazz collective that is deeply influenced by artists and groups such as: Robert Glasper\, Roy Hargrove\, and Lettuce. We perform a diverse repertoire of original contemporary jazz arrangements\, standards from The American Song Book\, and covers of beloved RnB songs from the 90s and mid 2000s. Each band member has a different musical background\, but we’ve drawn together due to our shared love of Jazz\, RnB\, Gospel and Pop music. Join us as we celebrate the music of Michael Jackson\, Luther Vandross\, Stevie Wonder\, and more! \n$15 General Admission \n$10 Student Tickets (in-store at Watermelon Music\, or at the door)
